Well, here's my obligatory first ascension (without cheating) post...long 
overdue since I've been playing Nethack for almost a year now.  (Would've
been sooner if Nethack hadn't crashed on me in no less than 3 awesome games)
I suspect I haven't got something quite right in my compilation (under OS/2),
so I quit, saved, and made a backup every once in while just in case another 
crash occurred, but fortunately none did.

Before I get to the juicy stats, I want to ask a question of all you other
'hackers: How long does an average winning game take you to play?  This game
took me between 20-25 hours to finish.  That seems excessively long.  Do you
play faster?

