Some comments and admissions:
- My wizard started out with an 18 STR and a 17 CON!!!!!  Talk about unusual.
- Only 1 damn shop (armor) (a tiny one at that) in the entire dungeon.
- Not one lawful altar in the entire dungeon.  I got my first holy water at
dungeon level 16 - sheesh. 
- Only one wand of wishing (in the castle) and it started with only 1 wish.
- I did do some polypiling to get some needed items, and convert some useless
items into useful ones, but not too much.  The game would have taken an
intolerable amount longer if I didn't do this.
- I did kick a few sinks.
- I didn't do any of the gold-getting tricks like leprechaun-taming, 
preist-stealing or pet-dropping.

